MC-Vector Dynmap source boundary

This directory contains a small, source-only snapshot selected from the Dynmap
repository for implementation research and attribution. The snapshot is not a
runtime dependency of MC-Vector, is not bundled into the frontend or Paper
plugin, and does not make MC-Vector Dynmap-compatible.

